  "description": "Inspired by Ashkaari's mod Blushing_Moon_Unit_Replacer <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KNU-lEBx2eVsfOPXzTLKREefWWkez4k8/view?usp=sharing>.It is a great mod that turn normal Cathay units to slaanesh corrupted Cathay units.\n\nBut not all Cathay units gets the reskin,So here I am.\n\nThe Purpose of This mod is to fit with the Miao ying Corruption Stages.To show the world what miao ying and her army has become lol XD.\n\nNow the mod includes The sky junk,The sky lantern,The Peasant Units,Iron Hail Gunners,Crane Gunners,Terracotta Sentinels, the artillery crew units\n\nJade warriors(Sword & Halberd & Crossbow & Lancer),Dragon guards(halberd & crossbow),Longma Riders and The War Drum.\n\nAlso add officers to Iron Hail gunners,Jade warriors and dragon guards\n\nPS:I changed the Crane Gunners so if you have any glitchs with it is because other mod has also changed the Crane Gunners so check for mod conflicts.If u don't like the change I make with crane gunners,feel free to use RPFM and remove it ?\n\nIf you like the mod Please consider donate me some coffe money.It took me a lot time and energy to make this mod.With your coffe I can be tireless on making mods.?\n\nHere is the paypal link:<https://paypal.me/donateToXl?country.x=C2&locale.x=zh_XC>",
  "changelog_latest": "The update is mainly about the Celestia Dragon guards,I change the color of the armour from purple and black TO purple, gold and black to make them look more badass and Elite.\n\nI also add four variants of Celestia Dragon officers(the guys standing at front).\n\nI also change the amount of flags on the back of Jade warriors so there are 4 variants in total and only 2 of them have flags on their back.\n\nAt Last I add the War drum reskin,Man I love these wardrums.Hope u guys like it too!?",
